Test: do-while loop
--------------------------------------
Basic do-while (count 0 to 4):
  i = 0
  i = 1
  i = 2
  i = 3
  i = 4

Do-while with false condition (executes once):
  j = 10

Do-while with break at 3:
  k = 0
  k = 1
  k = 2

Do-while with continue (skip evens):
  m = 1
  m = 3
  m = 5
